{"parse":{"title":"Conspiracy of the Golden Vault","pageid":409002,"revid":2050943,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f7/Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240303114600\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\">Verify details of intel hunt feature</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-stub\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Conspiracy of the Golden Vault</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/24/Talent_Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045619\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Conspiracy of the Golden Vault\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/24/Talent_Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045619\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/24/Talent_Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045619 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/24/Talent_Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045619 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Conspiracy of the Golden Vault\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Conspiracy of the Golden Vault.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gains 25% more rewards when dispatched on a <a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai\" title=\"Nod-Krai\">Nod-Krai</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Expedition\" title=\"Expedition\">Expedition</a> for 20 hours.<br />Additionally, as the head of the <a href=\"/wiki/Curatorium_of_Secrets_(Faction)\" title=\"Curatorium of Secrets (Faction)\">Curatorium of Secrets</a>, Nefer seemingly has the ability to obtain intelligence from a variety of sources — intelligence that certain factions in <a href=\"/wiki/Nasha_Town\" title=\"Nasha Town\">Nasha Town</a> might find extremely interesting...</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Expedition\" title=\"Expedition\">Expedition</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/20_Hour_Nod-Krai_Expedition_Reward\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"20 Hour Nod-Krai Expedition Reward\">20 Hour Nod-Krai Expedition Reward</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Conspiracy of the Golden Vault</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This passive grants Nefer access to the Intel Hunt feature, which is only available to members of the <a href=\"/wiki/Curatorium_of_Secrets_(Faction)\" title=\"Curatorium of Secrets (Faction)\">Curatorium of Secrets</a>.\n<ul><li>When Nefer is near <a href=\"/wiki/Recorded_Intel#How_to_Obtain\" title=\"Recorded Intel\">certain NPCs</a>, her <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Skill\" title=\"Elemental Skill\">Elemental Skill</a> will be replaced with a special intel-gathering skill. Using it on these NPCs will reveal additional information about them and potentially unlock exclusive dialogue and/or <a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" title=\"Quest\">quests</a>.\n<ul><li>For each NPC, gathering intel from them for the first time will reward <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Recorded_Intel\" title=\"Recorded Intel\"><img alt=\"Recorded Intel\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Recorded Intel.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Recorded_Intel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f2/Item_Recorded_Intel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20251023020746\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Recorded_Intel\" title=\"Recorded Intel\"><img alt=\"Recorded Intel\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Recorded Intel.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Recorded_Intel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f2/Item_Recorded_Intel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20251023020746\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Recorded_Intel\" title=\"Recorded Intel\">Recorded Intel</a> ×1</span></span>. Recorded Intel can be exchanged with <a href=\"/wiki/Katheryne\" title=\"Katheryne\">Katheryne</a> to unlock <a href=\"/wiki/Intel_Quest\" title=\"Intel Quest\">Intel Quests</a>.</li>\n<li>The intel-gathering skill has a fixed cooldown of 8.5 seconds, but uses Nefer's standard Elemental Skill animation.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Curatorium members can gather intel from a combined total of 6 new NPCs per <a href=\"/wiki/Weekly_Reset\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weekly Reset\">Weekly Reset</a>. Attempting to gather more intel with Nefer will trigger the following dialogue: <span class=\"audio-button custom-theme focusable\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Vo_mwgwq002_1_nefer_09.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20260109212626\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Vo mwgwq002 1 nefer 09.ogg\">Media:vo mwgwq002 1 nefer 09.ogg</a></span> <i>(Alright, time for a break. That's enough intel for now.)</i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Conspiracy of the Golden Vault</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">金室的密谋</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Conspiracy of the Golden Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">金室的密謀</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">金の密謀</span><br /><small><i>Kin no Mitsubou</i></small></td><td>Conspiracy of Gold</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">황금</span> <span lang=\"ko\">밀실의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">모략</span><br /><small><i>Hwanggeum Milsirui Moryak</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Intrigas de la c<span lang=\"es\">á</span>mara dorada</td><td>Intrigues of the Golden Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Conspiration du coffre-fort dor<span lang=\"fr\">é</span></td><td>Conspiracy of the Golden Strongbox</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Заговор</span> <span lang=\"ru\">золотой</span> <span lang=\"ru\">палаты</span><br /><small><i>Zagovor zolotoy palaty</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Conspiracy of the Golden Vault</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Âm Mưu Căn Phòng Vàng</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Verschw<span lang=\"de\">ö</span>rung der Goldenen Kammer</td><td>Conspiracy of the Golden Chamber</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Conspiracy of the Golden Vault</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Conspira<span lang=\"pt\">çã</span>o do Cofre Dourado</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Alt<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n Kasa Komplosu</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Cospirazione della camera dorata</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_II\" title=\"Version/Luna II\">Version \"Luna II\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Conspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+II%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Conspiracy+of+the+Golden+Vault\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConspiracy_of_the_Golden_Vault%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusa